    <p class=\"text-[9px] font-bold text-[var(--navy)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-7-2-3-2-1\">\n                            Your role\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"mt-1 text-[8px] leading-4 text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-7-2-3-2-2\">\n                            Student tools include scanning event codes and viewing your attendance history.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <button class=\"mt-4 flex h-10 w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-[9px] border border-[var(--line)] bg-white text-[10px] font-bold text-[var(--navy)]\" data-kid=\"1-3-7-2-3-3\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-logout\" data-kid=\"1-3-7-2-3-3-1\" style=\"font-size:15px;color:var(--blue);width:15px;height:15px\">\n                        </i>\n                        Sign out\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 flex h-[48px] items-center justify-around border-t border-[var(--line)] bg-white\" data-kid=\"1-3-7-2-4\">\n                    <div class=\"nav-item\" data-kid=\"1-3-7-2-4-1\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-home-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-7-2-4-1-1\" style=\"font-size:16px;color:var(--muted);width:16px;height:16px\">\n                        </i>\n                        Home\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"nav-item\" data-kid=\"1-3-7-2-4-2\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-qrcode\" data-kid=\"1-3-7-2-4-2-1\" style=\"font-size:16px;color:var(--muted);width:16px;height:16px\">\n                        </i>\n                        Scan\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"nav-item\" data-kid=\"1-3-7-2-4-3\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-clock\" data-kid=\"1-3-7-2-4-3-1\" style=\"font-size:16px;color:var(--muted);width:16px;height:16px\">\n                        </i>\n                        History\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"nav-item active\" data-kid=\"1-3-7-2-4-4\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-user\" data-kid=\"1-3-7-2-4-4-1\" style=\"font-size:16px;color:var(--blue);width:16px;height:16px\">\n                        </i>\n                        Profile\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </article>\n    </main>\n    <footer class=\"mx-auto mt-7 flex max-w-[1360px] items-center justify-between rounded-[14px] bg-[var(--navy)] px-5 py-3 text-[9px] text-white\" data-kid=\"1-4\">\n        <span class=\"font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-[#b8cde5]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1\">\n            Design principles\n        </span>\n        <span class=\"font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-4-2\">\n            One QR-ATT identity · Task-first home · Clear teacher/student roles · Scan flow preserved · Readable records · Errors with next steps\n        </span>\n    </footer>\n</div>\n",
