   Are you sure you want to sign out?\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-3 flex gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-3-4\">\n                    <button class=\"flex h-8 flex-1 items-center justify-center rounded-[7px] border border-white/30 text-[11px] font-semibold text-white\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-3-4-1\">\n                        Cancel\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"flex h-8 flex-1 items-center justify-center rounded-[7px] bg-white text-[11px] font-bold text-[#081B3A]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-3-4-2\">\n                        Sign Out\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n    <footer class=\"mt-4 flex items-center justify-between px-1 text-[11px] text-[#718198]\" data-kid=\"1-5\">\n        <span data-kid=\"1-5-1\">\n            QR-ATT · Navy & White design direction\n        </span>\n        <span data-kid=\"1-5-2\">\n            Existing attendance and account flows retained · Example data labels are placeholders\n        </span>\n    </footer>\n</div>\n<script>\n    (function(){\n    function makePreview(){\n      var el=document.getElementById('teacher-qr');\n      if(!el || !window.QRCode) return;\n      el.innerHTML='';\n      new QRCode(el,{text:JSON.stringify({v:1,event:'PREVIEW-ONLY',title:'Preview only'}),width:68,height:68,colorDark:'#081B3A',colorLight:'#FFFFFF',correctLevel:QRCode.CorrectLevel.M});\n    }\n    if(document.readyState==='loading') document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',makePreview); else makePreview();\n  })();\n</script>\n",
